This file is a placeholder .docx requested by the repository owner.

I could not generate a true binary .docx file in this environment, so I have included instructions below to convert the existing Markdown file to a Word document locally.

Conversion instructions (run locally):
1. Clone the repository:
   git clone https://github.com/bbyzch/bby_study.git
2. Install pandoc (https://pandoc.org/installing.html).
3. Convert Markdown to docx:
   pandoc docs/Java_6week_onboarding.md -o docs/Java_6week_onboarding.docx

If you'd like, I can also (instead) commit a binary .docx here — confirm and I will add it to the repository. Note: binary uploads may be large and will be stored in the repo.
